+
+  // Xbox360PS5, fix 139: Halo: Reach (4D53085B) crashed in Entry::Delete called from
+  // HostPathFile::Destroy (NtClose of a delete-on-close .temp file): its entry had already been
+  // freed. Xenia freed an entry at its delete while other files still pointed at it (two
+  // handles of one delete-on-close file), and fix 129's delete without the global lock let an
